{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Elixr 是一款結合吸收科學的保健品追蹤工具，會提示日常服用組閤中互相抵銷的保健品，並附上研究連結；適合已有固定保健品習慣、想理順服用時機的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-154.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>提示相沖與服用時機</h2>\n<p>Elixr 會標示 15 組有研究支持的相互作用組合，並附 PubMed 研究連結；可為保健品設定隨餐、空腹或避開咖啡茶等時機，再按時間表提醒。另有主畫面小工具、完成率檢視、iCloud 同步與 VoiceOver 支援，且無廣告、無追蹤、無第三方 SDK，一次購買即可使用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-431-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-432-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-433-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-434-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-435-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-436-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Elixr – Supplement Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/elixr-supplement-tracker/id6762560637?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T22:07:56.021701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:53:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T12:52:01.801116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T22:01:27.382275+00:00","content_hash":"e183b823d290f40a7ab3464a378be17fb57b6a75c7d17ccbde112b20e03c64c0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}